# Shared placeholder template. Copy locally; never commit a populated copy.
# Every process may load this file with: python tools/team/run.py <owner> <command> ...
# Repeat the SAME JWT secret and SAME per-service key wherever referenced below.
# Do not copy this file over an existing private .env.
